direction: right

Discord: {
  shape: cylinder
}

Riot Games API: {
  shape: cloud
}

Koga Bot (Node.js): {
  shape: package

  Discord Client: {
    shape: rectangle
  }

  Command Handler: {
    shape: rectangle
  }

  Polling Worker: {
    shape: rectangle
  }

  Riot API Service: {
    shape: rectangle
  }

  History Engine: {
    shape: rectangle
  }

  Database Service: {
    shape: rectangle
  }

  Discord Client -> Command Handler: Slash Commands
  Command Handler -> Database Service: /config_koga, /vincular, /status
  Command Handler -> Riot API Service: /vincular (Riot ID -> PUUID)

  Polling Worker -> Database Service: Jogadores monitorados / histórico
  Polling Worker -> Riot API Service: Novas partidas
  Polling Worker -> History Engine: Estatísticas da derrota
  Polling Worker -> Discord Client: Envia embed da análise
}

SQLite Database: {
  shape: cylinder
}

Discord -> Koga Bot (Node.js).Discord Client: Gateway (eventos)
Koga Bot (Node.js).Discord Client -> Discord: Mensagens/Embeds

Koga Bot (Node.js).Riot API Service -> Riot Games API: HTTP GET (ACCOUNT-V1, MATCH-V5)
Riot Games API -> Koga Bot (Node.js).Riot API Service: JSON

Koga Bot (Node.js).Database Service -> SQLite Database: Read/Write
SQLite Database -> Koga Bot (Node.js).Database Service: Results
